# Every pull request against this repository requests review from the owner.
#
# This exists because Dependabot's `reviewers:` configuration key was removed
# in May 2025; GitHub replaced it with code owners rather than maintaining two
# mechanisms for the same thing. A `reviewers:` entry in .github/dependabot.yml
# is now silently ignored, so this file is the only way to have review
# automatically requested on a Dependabot pull request.
#
# GitHub never requests review from the author of a pull request, so this does
# not fire on the owner's own PRs — only on Dependabot's and anyone else's.

